<title>UK: Brazil's Banco Real to launch dollar Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banco Real to launch dollar Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Banco Real is expected to launch a $200 million two-tranche Eurobond, lead manager WestMerchant bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>One tranche is expected to have a three-year maturity and the other a four-year maturity.</p>
<p>Launch is expected in July.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
